    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `publish_event.py` script, I need to choose a concrete external provider for managed messaging. Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS) is a suitable choice. I will use the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with SNS. The script will publish a JSON event to an SNS topic. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865739413,
          "start": 1789865737240
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4fbc180019ED2lbBMIu5J7t",
